{"v":4,"catch":"救人質！ 射擊敵人！\n不要錯過必備武器！","desc":"“GUERRILLA WAR”是SNK於1987年發布的一款生存射擊遊戲。\n控制叛亂領導人，並爭取從獨裁統治中奪回您的國家。\n使用手榴彈和坦克等強大武器擊敗敵人並奪回您的國家。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-02-25","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.0GB / Switch 0.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cf9fabaebc0ad75f8cb54754acf242d0561c7dd1cd6d6cf90343821221de628b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1eb259ddf71cfc8271eaee2741d369d13c6b75c3707cf38e344e8cd080d8f1aa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d74cb12d5c60080210833224eabac5625c4875da539c249f179e8a5c3af67992.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6c8ec349deced7b0e4ec067c1b98937bc18758c8554efe2b6fa147372356bdd1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0f52e75e3b913e2255566f0eab4b9f79aa06c26d928751047e64cfe6e3ffe019.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2f2c86dc8d4f60df7744dbced5b99a27d92626b5dc2e04d70f14abdc515c5928.jpg"],"titleId":"01003f4011d34000","dlc":[]}